{"seq":1,"slug":"iot-and-wearable-devices","title":"物联网与可穿戴设备","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/smart-care-technology/iot-and-wearable-devices","wordCount":1301,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"物联网与可穿戴设备\">物联网与可穿戴设备</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>我去一家智慧养老示范机构参观时，最打动我的不是墙上的大屏，而是一张看起来普普通通的床垫——它底下藏着毫米波雷达，老人睡在上面，心率、呼吸、有没有离床全都被悄悄记录，却完全感觉不到。那一刻我明白了智慧养老硬件的精髓：最好的设备，是让老人感觉不到的设备。</p>\n<p>这一节抓住：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物联网（IoT）</strong>：让设备&quot;能感知、能联网、能上报&quot;，是智慧养老的硬件基础。</li>\n<li><strong>可穿戴设备</strong>：手环、手表等贴身设备，测心率、步数、定位、跌倒。</li>\n<li><strong>非接触式监测</strong>：毫米波雷达、智能床垫，在不打扰、不侵犯隐私的前提下守护。</li>\n<li><strong>互联互通</strong>：Matter 等协议让不同品牌设备能&quot;说同一种语言&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"物联网在养老里到底做什么\">物联网在养老里到底做什么</h3><p>物联网这个词听着高深，拆开看就三件事：<strong>感知</strong>（传感器测数据）、<strong>传输</strong>（把数据发出去）、<strong>应用</strong>（系统拿数据做判断）。在养老场景里，一个智能手环测到心率（感知），通过网络传到平台（传输），平台发现心率异常就通知护理站（应用）。这条链路就是物联网的核心。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[感知:传感器/可穿戴] --&gt; B[传输:WiFi/蓝牙/4G]&#10;    B --&gt; C[平台:汇聚与分析]&#10;    C --&gt; D[应用:预警/记录/服务]&#10;    D -.反馈.-&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n    A[感知:传感器/可穿戴] --&gt; B[传输:WiFi/蓝牙/4G]\n    B --&gt; C[平台:汇聚与分析]\n    C --&gt; D[应用:预警/记录/服务]\n    D -.反馈.-&gt; A</pre><h3 id=\"两类设备-贴身的和环境的\">两类设备：贴身的和环境的</h3><p>养老监测设备大致分两类，各有长短：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>代表设备</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可穿戴（贴身）</td>\n<td>智能手环、手表</td>\n<td>测心率/定位/跌倒，随身</td>\n<td>老人常忘戴、嫌束缚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非接触（环境）</td>\n<td>毫米波雷达、智能床垫</td>\n<td>无感、不忘戴、护隐私</td>\n<td>安装固定、范围有限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可穿戴设备的硬伤是&quot;老人不爱戴&quot;——手环嫌勒、手表嫌沉，戴一天就扔抽屉。非接触式设备正是冲着这个痛点来的：毫米波雷达装在房间角落，老人什么都不用穿戴，雷达就能感知人体的微动、呼吸、跌倒，而且因为不拍画面，隐私顾虑也小得多。这也是为什么近几年非接触监测越来越火。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跌倒检测-一个值得展开的例子\">跌倒检测：一个值得展开的例子</h3><p>跌倒是老人致残致死的头号风险，所以跌倒检测几乎是智慧养老设备的标配。它的原理可以简化理解：设备持续监测人体的加速度或位置变化，当检测到&quot;快速下坠 + 随后长时间静止不动&quot;时，就判定为疑似跌倒。</p>\n<p>用加速度举个直观例子。人正常活动时合加速度大致在 1g 上下波动（g 为重力加速度），跌倒瞬间会出现一个远超日常的冲击峰值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>合</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{\\text{合}} = \\sqrt{a_x^2 + a_y^2 + a_z^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">合</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.84em;vertical-align:-0.6276em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2124em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1724em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6276em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>合</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{\\text{合}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">合</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过某个阈值（比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>）、紧接着一段时间内人体几乎不动，系统就触发报警。当然真实算法要复杂得多，还要靠数据训练来减少误报（比如把&quot;坐下太猛&quot;和&quot;真摔倒&quot;区分开），但核心思路就是抓&quot;剧烈冲击 + 随后静止&quot;这个特征。</p>\n<h3 id=\"互联互通-比单品更重要\">互联互通：比单品更重要</h3><p>一家机构往往用了好几个品牌的设备，如果它们各说各话、数据进不了同一个平台，那就成了一堆信息孤岛。Matter 这类互联互通协议的意义就在这里——它让不同品牌、不同平台的设备能接入同一个生态，无缝协作。对采购方来说，&quot;这个设备支不支持开放协议&quot;有时比&quot;它本身多智能&quot;更重要，因为前者决定了它能不能融进你已有的系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>给你认识的一位独居老人选监测设备，你会选可穿戴还是非接触式？说出你的理由和取舍。</li>\n<li>用加速度公式想一想：为什么单看&quot;出现冲击峰值&quot;不足以判定跌倒，还要加上&quot;随后静止&quot;这个条件？</li>\n<li>为什么说&quot;老人不爱戴手环&quot;是可穿戴设备的硬伤？这对产品设计提出了什么要求？</li>\n<li>解释一下：为什么采购设备时要关注它是否支持 Matter 这类开放协议？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>查一份近一年的&quot;智能养老设备白皮书&quot;，看看市面主流设备的分类和参数。</li>\n<li>了解毫米波雷达的工作原理科普，你会对&quot;非接触测呼吸&quot;这件神奇的事有更清楚的认识。</li>\n<li>Matter 协议的官方介绍，理解智能家居互联互通的大趋势如何延伸到养老。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们认识了智慧养老的硬件底座：物联网的&quot;感知—传输—应用&quot;链路，以及可穿戴和非接触两类设备的取舍，还拆解了跌倒检测的基本原理。但设备采到的数据只是原材料，怎么把它变成有用的判断和服务？下一节我们就上升到数据平台与 AI 服务这一层。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"物联网与可穿戴设备","id":"物联网与可穿戴设备"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"物联网在养老里到底做什么","id":"物联网在养老里到底做什么"},{"level":3,"text":"两类设备：贴身的和环境的","id":"两类设备-贴身的和环境的"},{"level":3,"text":"跌倒检测：一个值得展开的例子","id":"跌倒检测-一个值得展开的例子"},{"level":3,"text":"互联互通：比单品更重要","id":"互联互通-比单品更重要"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"认知症与心理照护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care/dementia-and-mental-health-care"},"next":{"title":"数据平台与 AI 服务","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/smart-care-technology/data-platform-and-ai-services"}}